        "phase": "execute",
        "reason": "Verilator 5.052 writes the out-of-range bit of a partially out-of-range indexed part-select (minus_write[i -: 2] with i = 0) into bit 7 instead of discarding it; IEEE 1800-2023 11.5.1 ignores writes to out-of-range bits. Icarus agrees with the expected value.",
